From: Kurtisone <104103601+Kurtisone@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Vulkan: uploads that stay fast on Qualcomm drivers

---
--- a/src/graphics/vulkan/texture_cache.cpp
+++ b/src/graphics/vulkan/texture_cache.cpp
